Question data licence
=====================

The sample questions in src/data/sampleQuestions.ts are written for Call It and
released under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
licence (CC BY-SA 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

The live ranked question bank is kept out of this public repository on purpose,
so answers can't be looked up during a run. It lives only in the game's
database.

The app's source code is under the MIT licence (see LICENSE in the repository root).
